   "ANSWER": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1403\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1471\" data-start=\"1403\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1471\" data-start=\"1405\"><strong data-end=\"1425\" data-start=\"1405\">Confidentiality:</strong> Ensuring only authorized users access data.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1472\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1538\" data-start=\"1474\"><strong data-end=\"1488\" data-start=\"1474\">Integrity:</strong> Protecting data from unauthorized modification.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1539\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1541\"><strong data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1541\">Availability:</strong> Ensuring resources are accessible to authorized users when needed.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
