 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 13258,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"8111\" data-start=\"7758\"><strong data-end=\"7771\" data-start=\"7760\">Answer Key:</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2256\" data-start=\"2241\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"2831\" data-start=\"2257\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2388\" data-start=\"2257\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2388\" data-start=\"2260\"><strong data-end=\"2277\" data-start=\"2260\">Masquerading:</strong> Pretending to be another user to bypass authentication.<br data-end=\"2336\" data-start=\"2333\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2349\" data-start=\"2339\">Example:</em> Logging in using stolen credentials.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2550\" data-start=\"2389\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2550\" data-start=\"2392\"><strong data-end=\"2411\" data-start=\"2392\">Replay Attacks:</strong> Reusing captured valid data to repeat transactions.<br data-end=\"2466\" data-start=\"2463\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2479\" data-start=\"2469\">Example:</em> Re-sending a captured bank transfer request to transfer money again.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2678\" data-start=\"2551\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2678\" data-start=\"2554\"><strong data-end=\"2579\" data-start=\"2554\">Message Modification:</strong> Changing data in transit.<br data-end=\"2608\" data-start=\"2605\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2621\" data-start=\"2611\">Example:</em> Altering a file sent over a network to insert malware.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2831\" data-start=\"2679\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2831\" data-start=\"2682\"><strong data-end=\"2707\" data-start=\"2682\">Privilege Escalation:</strong> Gaining higher system privileges illegally.<br data-end=\"2754\" data-start=\"2751\" />\n\t<em data-end=\"2767\" data-start=\"2757\">Example:</em> Using a malicious script to gain root access in a Linux system.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
